  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stimson Centre - The ATT at 10 Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding for a project by The Henry L. Stimson Centre to examine the original intent of the Arms Trade Treaty and the challenges and progress since 2013. For DAC eligible countries, the project will help identify strategies and good practices for effective treaty implementation and bring forward issues of concern and relevance for a diversity of stakeholders. The project will allow often-underrepresented voices to be featured in reflections on the treaty&#x2019;s first decade and heard with regards to recommendations for the next decade.</narrative>
  </description>
